From: wee8 maintenance <noreply@moonbitlang.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 10:18:18 +0800
Subject: Make the JavaScript RegExp library an optional build capability

Upstream-Status: Local runtime capability policy
Maintenance: Review registrations, external references, generated Torque code and direct RegExp callers on every V8 upgrade.
Tests: Native RegExp rejection, builtin inventories, packaged native string consumers.
